ach element shifted n steps forward along index i (or back if n is ne~~
gative). Leaves zero in first (or last) n elements, since there is no~~
 preceding (following) value to shift into them.Definition: VAR r := Slice(x, i, Cumulate(1, i) - n);~
IF r = NULL THEN 0 ELSE rNodelocation: 88,488,1Nodesize: 76,20Windstate: 2,102,90,476,278Paramnames: x,n,iVariable Earthquake_rateTitle: Earthquake rateUnits: Years / quakeDescription: Mean number of years between earthquakesDefinition: 10Nodelocation: 72,48,1Nodesize: 48,24Windstate: 2,50,540,476,224Chance Number_of_quakesTitle: Number of quakesUnits: quakes / quarterDescription: The number of quakes that occur in each time period (quar~~
